    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 5,
      "id": "P3-S5",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "But what we forget—what our economy depends on us forgetting—is that happiness is more than pleasure without pain.",
    "translation": "但我们忘记了——我们的经济依赖于我们的忘记——幸福不仅仅是没有痛苦的快乐。",
