  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t4",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 7,
      "ps": "P3-S7"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 7,
      "id": "P3-S7",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "Today, surrounded by promises of easy happiness, we need art to tell us, as religion once did, Memento mori: remember that you will die, that everything ends, and that happiness comes not in denying this but in living with it.",
    "translation": "今天，我们被轻松幸福的承诺所包围，我们需要艺术来告诉我们，就像宗教曾经那样，“死亡的象征”：记住你会死，一切都会结束，幸福不是来自于否认这一点，而是来自于与它一起生活。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2006.js",
